WEBVTT

NOTE
Timestamps use the original Library of Congress MP3 clock.
See voices.yaml for the excerpt start and end.

fountain-hughes-01
00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.570
<v Fountain Hughes>Colored people that's free ought to be awful
thankful.</v>

fountain-hughes-02
00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.830
<v Fountain Hughes>And some of them is sorry they are free now.</v>

fountain-hughes-03
00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.130
<v Fountain Hughes>Some of them now would rather be slaves.</v>

fountain-hughes-04
00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:02.730
<v Hermond Norwood>Which had you rather be Uncle Fountain?</v>

fountain-hughes-05
00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.120
<v Fountain Hughes>Me? Which I'd rather be?</v>

fountain-hughes-06
00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.550
<v Fountain Hughes>[Norwood laughs] You know what I'd rather
do?</v>

fountain-hughes-07
00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.950
<v Fountain Hughes>If I thought, had any idea,</v>

fountain-hughes-08
00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.130
<v Fountain Hughes>that I'd ever be a slave again,</v>

fountain-hughes-09
00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:23.110
<v Fountain Hughes>I'd take a gun and just end it all right
away.</v>

fountain-hughes-10
00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.670
<v Fountain Hughes>Because you're nothing but a dog.</v>

fountain-hughes-11
00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.690
<v Fountain Hughes>You're not a thing but a dog.</v>

fountain-hughes-12
00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:36.290
<v Fountain Hughes>Night never comed out, you had nothing to
do.</v>

fountain-hughes-13
00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.250
<v Fountain Hughes>Time to cut tobacco,</v>

fountain-hughes-14
00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:44.110
<v Fountain Hughes>if they want you to cut all night long out
in the field, you cut.</v>

fountain-hughes-15
00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:49.580
<v Fountain Hughes>And if they want you to hang all night long,</v>

fountain-hughes-16
00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.190
<v Fountain Hughes>you hang, hang tobacco.</v>

fountain-hughes-17
00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:56.300
<v Fountain Hughes>It didn't matter about your tired, being
tired.</v>

fountain-hughes-18
00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.030
<v Fountain Hughes>You're afraid to say you're tired.</v>

fountain-hughes-19
00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.600
<v Fountain Hughes>They just, well [voice trails off].</v>
